OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Johnson & Johnson offices
OL,4,Acould go for homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn office complex recently used by
OL,7,FJohnson & Johnson could be demolished
OL,8,Fto make way for more than 130 homes.
OL,10,FThe Pinewood Campus in Crowthorne,
OL,11,FBerkshire, was previously used by the
OL,12,Fpharmaceutical and medical giant but it
OL,13,Fmoved staff from there and another base
OL,14,Fin High Wycombe to Maidenhead earlier
OL,15,Fthis year.
OL,17,FDeveloper Dandara said it wanted to
OL,18,Fdemolish the complex and build 136 new
OL,19,Fhomes on the site, as detailed in plans
OL,20,Fsubmitted to Wokingham Borough Council.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
